{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は名古屋で15枚目シングル\n裸足でSummerの全国握手会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブでは、\n裸足でSummerと僕だけの光に\n参加しました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらくライブしてなかったから\nいつものミニライブのステージより\n緊張した！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/18/0291938/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/18/0291938/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/18/0291938/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会のペアは変更があったため\nみり愛と絢音のレーンにお邪魔して\n3人でだったよ～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、握手会がはじまって\n気づいたんだけど\nこの3人で\nきぐちゃんレーンだったの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/18/0291938/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/18/0291938/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左から\nちーむごのきぐ\nちーむくのきぐ\nちーむらのきぐ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右から\nちーむらのきぐ\nちーむくのきぐ\nちーむごのきぐ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/18/0291938/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会の最後の方になると\n毎回恒例になりつつある\n笑のツボが浅くなってしまい\nネジが外れたようにずっと笑ってる。\nっていう現象が\nとなりにいた絢音にもうつって\n絢音もケタケタ笑ってたよ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、みり愛って独特だなって\n今日となりでファンの方との会話を聞いてて\n思いました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや～おもしろかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの握手会すごくたのしかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さん\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待たせしてしまった時間があったと\n思いますが。。。\nすみません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の名古屋は11月！\n個別握手会ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を着よう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/18/0291938/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/18/0291938/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳と17歳と18歳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉さん(*´꒳`*)♪へへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/18/0291938/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は祝日ですが\nまた1週間が始まりますね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばらなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スケジュール帳を買ったんだけど\nなごやに持って行くの忘れちゃって\n一言日記書けなかったから\nおうち着いたら書こうと～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日ブログを書いてるけど\n一言日記も大事だと思って\n始めたんだよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつまで続くかな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、またあした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は深く眠ってしまいそう！"}],"source":"archive"}